    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TRAVEL-HOLIDAY\nNATIONAL TRAVEL POLL\nBEST INTERNATIONAL\n1985\nAIRLINE\nBest International Airline -\nfifth year in a row.\n€ aIr new ZEaLanD\n747 Schedule\nEffective from Oct. 27, 1985\nWorld's Best International Airline for the fifth year in a row.",
      "Additional Services New Zealand to Australia\nTE 141\n767\nMON\nTE 53\n767\nTE 49\n747\nTE 123\n747\nTUE\nTE 131\nTE 151 TE 147\n747\n767\n767\nWEDNESDAY\n1220\nTE 113\n747\nTE 61\n747\nTHURSDAY\nTE 45\n767\nAuckland\nWellington\nChristchurch\nBrisbane\nSydney\nMelbourne\nHobart\nPerth\nLV\nLV\nLV\nAr\nAr\nAr\nAr\nAr\n1100\n1700\n0950\n0800\n1745\n1125\n1235\n1245\n0720\n0750\n1455\n1115\n1345\n1910\n1615\n1310\n1255\n0955\n1910\nAdditional Services Australia to New Zealand\nTE 144 TE 102\n767\n747\nMON\nTE 16\n747\nTUESDAY\nTE 54\n767\nTE 124 TE 66 TE 154 TE 132\n747\n747\n767\n747\nTE 44 TE 146\n767\n767\nWEDNESDAY\nTHURSDAY\nPerth\nHobart\nMelbourne\nSydney\nBrisbane\nChristchurch\nWellington\nAuckland\nLV\nLV\nLV\nLV\nLV\nAr\nAr\nAr\n1425\n1425\n1110\n1235\n1515\n1400\n0900\n1730\n1850\n1945\n1415\n2030\n0920\n1355\n1735\n1635\n2230\n2005\n1950\n1520\nair nEw ZEaLaND\nTE 51\n767\nFRIDAY\nTE 137\n747\n1145\nTE 141\nTE 73\nTE 47\nTE 123\nTE 165\n767\n737\n767\n747\n767\nSATURDAY\nSUNDAY\n1100\n0930\n1410\n0800\n1030\n1805\n1210\n1455\n1055\n1925\n0945\n1255\n1150\nAnnouncing WELLINGTON service to/from Sydney,\nMelbourne, and Brisbane commencing this fall on\nboard our new B767ER aircraft.\nTE 114 TE 52\n747\n767\nFRIDAY\n0810\nTE 138\n747\nTE 46 TE 74\n767\n737\nSATURDAY\nTE 124 TE 142 TE 166\n747\n767\n767\nSUNDAY\n1250\n1100\n1425\n1210\n0800\n1340\n1610\n1620\n1705\n1735\n1300\n2230\n1920\n1940\n1950\nNOTE:\nSchedule effective from Oct. 27, 1985 and subject to change without notice."
